From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dreeam <61569423+Dreeam-qwq@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 02:31:59 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 64/95] Add TOML configuration engine

- Ported from Leaf Config v2 and the Leaf legacy converter (Winds-Studio/Leaf, GPL-3.0-only)
- Add com.destroystokyo.paper.config.toml engine on Night-Config 3.8.0 with comment-preserving antarctic.toml
- Add @ConfigInfo, @HotReloadUnsupported, @DoNotLoad, @Experimental annotations, EnumConfigCategory and IConfigModule
- Port all existing settings to category modules (misc, network, optimizations, gameplay, fixes)
- Migrate antarctic.yml to antarctic.toml automatically on first start; rename legacy file to antarctic.yml.migrated
- Keep Server.Spigot#getAntarcticConfig YAML facade for plugins and timings; add getAntarcticTomlConfig
- Repoint NMS consumers to module fields; rewrite config tests for TOML semantics
- Use builder().sync() instead of ofConcurrent(): Night-Config 3.8.0 debounces async saves to a background executor

